<title>USA: CMG to buyback up to 500,000 shares.</title>
<headline>CMG to buyback up to 500,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Mass. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>CMG Information Services Inc on Friday CMGI.N said it intends to repurchase up to 500,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The purchases will be made in the open market or in privately negotiated transactions from time to time, depending on market conditions, CMG said.</p>
<p>CMG has approximately 9.2 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
